{"steam_appid":2789810,"steam_name":"Bingle Bingle","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2789810/1110048136/2dc9353b1294a8e5d5180d6a8bc6648f92ae3d2f/1781372616/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1784492048","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257331121/761b5e4c73440476eb6d80c87a2d39fab3a2bd48/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1784492048","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/6c15b44856c0bcedeb3d88cb9589019062d7b8f7/ss_6c15b44856c0bcedeb3d88cb9589019062d7b8f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784492049","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/0ece9afae6df10640f016ab93808007ace7605f2/ss_0ece9afae6df10640f016ab93808007ace7605f2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784492049","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/4b85da10b8661fe2b0f7a26eb5254b2091f96fff/ss_4b85da10b8661fe2b0f7a26eb5254b2091f96fff.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784492049","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/aa4e1917129e4f06ed139419dc0bbb9ed285f1b8/ss_aa4e1917129e4f06ed139419dc0bbb9ed285f1b8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784492049","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/87560e84f3e024b6cd9181aab83e6d5bb9655856/ss_87560e84f3e024b6cd9181aab83e6d5bb9655856.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784492049"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/extras/bb9bab77f645f985a8d374c583117f53.avif?t=1784492049\" width=612 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/extras/b3a9e368e20ba24cd395bacc5f9357aa.poster.avif?t=1784492049\" width=612 height=241 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/extras/b3a9e368e20ba24cd395bacc5f9357aa.webm?t=1784492049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing Bingle Bingle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bingle Bingle&quot; is a &quot;roulette-building&quot; game where you create your own roulette wheel and build strategies around it. Your goal is to combine balls, bets, tokens, pockets, and badges to create adrenaline-pumping synergies, win millions or billions of chips, and beat the casino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/extras/19575a73cc45dec81d7555dc9183236f.poster.avif?t=1784492049\" width=612 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/extras/19575a73cc45dec81d7555dc9183236f.webm?t=1784492049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your own roulette!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn every number into the same number, freeze pockets, install portals, or even devour them!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine over 200 badges with 20 quest rewards to create your own build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/extras/d3507bb8b4781f8ba6f69f7231aa8ea8.avif?t=1784492049\" width=612 height=110 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against the casino's animal dealers, earn bigger rewards, and strengthen your deck!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/extras/2afebbe15a965f5d01ff0b6ce58b81fa.avif?t=1784492049\" width=640 height=320 /></span></h2></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, you start over from the beginning, testing both your skill and your luck.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the item combinations that can break through the changing situations of every run.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your first clear, House Edge mode lets you challenge casinos under 18 far harsher conditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with 300 chips, then challenge yourself to win 1 million, 10 million, and even billions of chips in Endless Mode.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a class and use special abilities! Five classes with distinct play styles are waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/extras/caf257d1538d0305614e5f1535b4c88b.poster.avif?t=1784492049\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/extras/caf257d1538d0305614e5f1535b4c88b.webm?t=1784492049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/extras/caf257d1538d0305614e5f1535b4c88b.mp4?t=1784492049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear 14 challenge modes, each with its own special conditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789810/extras/03494c534324bef707fb4d4e67030c78.avif?t=1784492049\" width=612 height=96 /></span></p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Knitting Games"],"publishers":["Knitting Games"],"release_date":"22 Jun, 2026"}